&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgHaGsPLKTnYZCbSvaYMsQmg&quot;&gt;As the HRBP Expert/Senior HR Manager for our Global Commercial Center, you will translate business objectives into impactful people strategies. You will be instrumental in enhancing organizational effectiveness, leading through transformational organizational changes, and developing the next generation of leaders, all within a dynamic, international context that values your strategic insight.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
